<title>NETHERLANDS: KAS-ASSOCIATIE 1996 PROFIT DFL 24.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>KAS-ASSOCIATIE 1996 PROFIT DFL 24.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     8.41 vs   5.10 </p>
<p>    Net profit			    24.1  vs  14.6 </p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  4.20 vs   3.60 </p>
<p>Note - Full name is Kas-Associatie NV.</p>
<p>Kas-Associatie said it would publish a forecast for 1997 in</p>
<p>its 1996 annual report, which will be published on April 18.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
